{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "comment": [
    "The shop serves the domain root; the original static site is at /old/.",
    "",
    "This project now HAS a build step, which it did not before. It is required:",
    "copy is edited through /edit/, an edit commits JSON, and only a rebuild turns",
    "that JSON into HTML. Nothing generated is committed any more.",
    "",
    "installCommand needs --include=dev: Vercel sets NODE_ENV=production, npm ci",
    "then skips devDependencies, and `astro check` would try to auto-install",
    "@astrojs/check at build time - which a non-interactive build cannot do.",
    "",
    "Serverless functions still come from the repo's api/ directory, independently",
    "of outputDirectory.",
    "",
    "The redirects keep every URL that was ever live working - including the",
    "/new/assets/... the committed /social page still asks for."
  ],
  "installCommand": "cd standalone && npm ci --include=dev",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": "out",
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/new",
      "destination": "/",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/new/:path*",
      "destination": "/:path*",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/collection.html",
      "destination": "/old/collection.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/heritage.html",
      "destination": "/old/heritage.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/admin.html",
      "destination": "/old/admin.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/about.html",
      "destination": "/old/about.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/help.html",
      "destination": "/old/help.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/icons.html",
      "destination": "/old/icons.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/story.html",
      "destination": "/old/story.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/product.html",
      "destination": "/old/product.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/product-cap.html",
      "destination": "/old/product-cap.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/product-establishment.html",
      "destination": "/old/product-establishment.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/product-roll-call.html",
      "destination": "/old/product-roll-call.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/product-roundel.html",
      "destination": "/old/product-roundel.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/product-skull.html",
      "destination": "/old/product-skull.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/light/:path*",
      "destination": "/old/light/:path*",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/newui.css",
      "destination": "/old/newui.css",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/styles.css",
      "destination": "/old/styles.css",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/main.js",
      "destination": "/old/main.js",
      "permanent": true
    }
  ]
}
